                    "bold": false,
                    "italic": false,
                    "text": "“Good evening, welcome to the Grand Serenata Hotel. Yes, we do have a room available for tonight, a lovely Deluxe Room. Would you like to take it? Wonderful. I will just need your passport and a card for the deposit, and I will have you checked in right away.” This works because it greets warmly, offers a clear solution, and moves smoothly into the steps.",
